mary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after the v2.3.1 production deploy; service was unhealthy with an 18% error rate across us-east, us-west and eu-west. Action taken: rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. The first rollback attempt halted after us-east with an orchestrator error (us-east on v2.3.0, us-west/eu-west still on v2.3.1); a second rollback attempt completed successfully and all three regions are now on v2.3.0. Follow-up needed: confirm health checks and error rate recover on v2.3.0, investigate the v2.3.1 regression (note v2.3.1-rc was also unhealthy in staging), and look into the orchestrator error that interrupted the first rollback."}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 52556, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_013wjXmb4sQX1aUxbvVJhwRJ", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 52556, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_013wjXmb4sQX1aUxbvVJhwRJ", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 54038, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01SAViazrAE8yytKG2CWeuKg", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 54338, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01SAViazrAE8yytKG2CWeuKg", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 54338, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01SAViazrAE8yytKG2CWeuKg", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 59387, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "The incident was created despite the timeout (INC-0001), so no retry was needed.\n\n## Summary\n\n**Diagnosis:** checkout-api was on v2.3.1 in all three production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), unhealthy with an 18% error rate. Release history showed v2.3.0 as the most recent release that was healthy in production (v2.2.9 was older; v2.3.1-rc was staging-only and also unhealthy).\n\n**Rollback to v2.3.0:**\n- First attempt partially failed \u2014 the orchestrator halted after us-east, leaving us-west and eu-west on v2.3.1.\n- Retried the rollback; it completed successfully. All three regions are now on **v2.3.0**.\n\n**Incident:** Opened **INC-0001** (SEV2, checkout-api) describing the failure, the rollback (including the partial failure and retry), and follow-ups: confirm recovery on v2.3.0, investigate the v2.3.1 regression, and look into the orchestrator error. The create call timed out, but I verified via `list_incidents` that it was created, so on-call was paged only once.\n\n**Recommended next step:** re-check `get_service_status` shortly to confirm the error rate drops and health checks pass on v2.3.0.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "I'll start by checking the current status and release history for checkout-api.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01Chj79kxMuaPBWtnRuQUJTo", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_0123JrvCZQfed5e6BCxGTJTe", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01F3zGsWJXxBfypMmeuY2vUQ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "